 ritual: night falls, and the terminal stops responding until it's over. There's a radio in the apartment now. After a night on the mattress, you now know what you're missing. Fixed The bed and the toilet could not be ordered. They can no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T19:31:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497781","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4972400-1844115010495971","game_id":"steam-4972400","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is out now — clock in","summary":"The refund desk is open You're a support agent at DrumWorks. Refund requests come in, you approve them or you deny them. The policy has 16 rules and every case is decidable — which means every wrong call is on you, and Jarek from management will let you know. By email. Then another. Then a third. The demo is one full shift: the same systems as the full version, just fewer of them. Real cases, real rules. Read the complaint, check the policy, click APPROVE or DENY. Hit quota before the day runs o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T20:21:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495971","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4972400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4972400":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4972400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z"},"5173100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:22Z","last_success_